### 배송정보 삭제
DELETE {{admin}}/dispatch/delivery/3
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{access-token}}


### 배차 확정
PUT {{admin}}/dispatch/5/dispatched
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{access-token}}


{
  "deliveryOrders": [
    {
      "vehicleSeq": 3,
      "deliverySeqList": [10, 9]
    }
  ]
}


### 배차 대기 상태로 변경
PUT {{admin}}/dispatch/4/waiting
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{access-token}}



### 샘플 엑셀 다운로드
GET {{admin}}/dispatch/delivery/excel/download-sample-delivery/5
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{access-token}}



### 배송정보 엑셀 업로드
POST {{admin}}/dispatch/delivery/excel/upload/5
Authorization: Bearer {{access-token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boudary

--boudary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="test.xlsx"

< d:/test.xlsx
--boudary--


### 배송정보 엑셀 다운로드
GET {{admin}}/dispatch/delivery/excel/download/5
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{access-token}}